          "Prepare Hydrafacial machine with Ice Probe, Ocular ultrasound infusion, Face ultrasound infusion, suction/bubble pen, and appropriate disposables.",
          "Load Hydrafacial serums (SA2, A03) and ensure PDRN/Exosome options are available for optional use in infusion steps.",
          "Have Charcoal mask ready for oily skin detox and a mild glycolic/Salicylic peel (e.g., Glyco 35% or Salicylic 30%) available with neutralizer if needed.",
          "Set aside neutralizer, sunscreen (SPF 30+), cleansers, moisturizers, and finishing serums.",
          "Apply eye shields and verify patient comfort; prepare cold pack if requested.",
          "Sanitize room, prep towels, and ensure proper temperature/lighting for a relaxing experience.",
          "Confirm no Aloe Vera or Vitamin C allergies before formulation.",
          "Have lymphatic drainage massage plan and timer ready."
        ],
